# Public reCAPTCHA v2 site key for the login screen (see ../CLAUDE.md).
# Not a secret -- it's meant to ship in frontend JS. Vite bakes VITE_*
# vars in at build time, so this must be set (copy to .env, or export in
# the shell) BEFORE `npm run build` -- the frontend/dist this produces is
# what the top-level Dockerfile copies into the image (see ../scripts/build.sh).
# Empty = the login screen renders without the reCAPTCHA widget, unchanged.
VITE_RECAPTCHA_SITE_KEY=
